---
import Layout from '../layouts/SiteLayout.astro';
---

<Layout
  title="Open source"
  active="open-source"
  description="Open-source tools from Idle Fusion, including HealthKit Run Generator, a Swift package that creates realistic running workout data for developers."
>
  <section class="page-intro wrap">
    <span class="label"><span class="idx">Open source</span> Built here, shared openly</span>
    <h1 class="h1">Useful to us. Yours to <span class="hand ochre">build on.</span></h1>
    <div class="intro-row">
      <p class="lede">
        Tools born from real projects, shared with the people making what comes next.
      </p>
      <a class="link-arrow" href="https://github.com/idlefusion">Find us on GitHub</a>
    </div>
  </section>
  <section class="wrap oss-feature">
    <div>
      <span class="label"><span class="idx">01</span> Swift package</span>
      <h2 class="h2">HealthKit Run Generator</h2>
      <p>
        Realistic running workout data for developers. Create outdoor runs with GPS routes or indoor
        treadmill sessions, complete with heart rate, cadence, pace, and elevation.
      </p>
      <ul class="plain-list">
        <li>Five run profiles, from easy runs to race day</li>
        <li>Deterministic seeds for reproducible test data</li>
        <li>Training plans and batch generation</li>
      </ul>
      <div class="actions">
        <a class="btn" href="https://github.com/mps/healthkit-run-generator">
          <span class="btn-text">View the source</span><span class="btn-arrow" aria-hidden="true"
            >→</span
          >
        </a>
        <a class="link-arrow" href="/healthkit-run-generator/"
          >Project documentation <span aria-hidden="true">→</span></a
        >
      </div>
    </div>
    <div class="code-art" aria-label="HealthKit Run Generator capabilities">
      <span class="label">A runner’s world. A developer’s tool.</span>
      <pre><span class="code-comment">// More realistic data. Less setup.</span>

Outdoor runs   → GPS + elevation
Indoor runs    → Treadmill + incline
Run profiles   → Easy, tempo, intervals
Reproducible   → Seed-based generation
Output         → HealthKit + JSON</pre>
      <div class="code-bottom">
        <span>SWIFT PACKAGE</span>
        <span>iOS 17+ · macOS 14+</span>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>
  <section class="wrap band" aria-labelledby="practice-title">
    <div>
      <span class="label" style="margin-bottom:16px"
        ><span class="idx">02</span> An ongoing practice</span
      >
      <h2 id="practice-title" class="h2">
        Make something. Share what <span class="hand">helps.</span>
      </h2>
    </div>
    <div>
      <p>
        Our open-source work grows out of the problems we meet while building products. Explore the
        code, open an issue, or contribute an improvement.
      </p>
      <a class="link-arrow" href="https://github.com/mps/healthkit-run-generator"
        >Explore the repository</a
      >
    </div>
  </section>
</Layout>
